          ],
          "content": "**1.** The meaning of a tangent to a circle."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.213,
            0.847,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": "**2.** The tangent to a circle is perpendicular to the radius through the point of contact."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.236,
            0.788,
            0.255
          ],
          "content": "**3.** The lengths of the two tangents from an external point to a circle are equal."
        },
